@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = replace-with-user-token
@projectId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@jobId = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222

### Researcher dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboards/researcher
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Deadline page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deadlines?state=OVERDUE&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Available reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/report-definitions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Queue portfolio export
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/report-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: portfolio-example-1

{"reportCode":"PROJECT_PORTFOLIO_STATUS","format":"CSV","parameters":{"projectIds":["{{projectId}}"]}}

### Poll job
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/report-jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtain relative content URL; send Authorization again when following it
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/report-jobs/{{jobId}}/download-authorization
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
